dotengine/godot/pull/119995.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:18Z"},"body":"## What problem does this solve\r\n\r\nForgot to include this in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119497 😐\r\n\r\nIt cleans up the first parameter of `Point2i` in `EditorAudioStreamPicker::_preview_draw()` using the local variable created in the PR above. Someone could call it a micro-optimization, but I think that the compiler did this already, and the effect would be one multiplication operation and function call less, which is basically zero.\r\n\r\n## Additional info\r\n\r\nReplaces\r\n`EDSCALE * 4 + icon->get_width()`\r\nwith\r\n`size.width - text_width`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119995/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}